    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death Of The Acountdown : \u6b7b\u4ea1\u5012\u8ba1\u65f6 allows you to fill out a questionnaire to predict your age, and it can be displayed at the top of the desktop. It supports multiple countdown modes, including year, month, day, hour, minute, and second, remaining days, remaining seconds, and you can freely switch between multiple display modes. It supports re-filling the questionnaire and re-predicting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sample questionnaire filling:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722500/extras/6232f6fb53db54d1ece34b15f6d5c053.poster.avif?t=1750296368\" width=800 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722500/extras/6232f6fb53db54d1ece34b15f6d5c053.webm?t=1750296368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722500/extras/6232f6fb53db54d1ece34b15f6d5c053.mp4?t=1750296368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Predicted death countdown and switching display mode: year-month-day-hour-minute-second, remaining days, remaining seconds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722500/extras/d3ef08e4275e26e1fe1b69f4f0831e07.poster.avif?t=1750296368\" width=800 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722500/extras/d3ef08e4275e26e1fe1b69f4f0831e07.webm?t=1750296368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722500/extras/d3ef08e4275e26e1fe1b69f4f0831e07.mp4?t=1750296368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death Of The Acountdown : \u6b7b\u4ea1\u5012\u8ba1\u65f6 allows you to fill out a questionnaire to predict your age, and it can be displayed at the top of the desktop. It supports multiple countdown modes, including year, month, day, hour, minute, and second, remaining days, remaining seconds, and you can freely switch between multiple display modes. It supports re-filling the questionnaire and re-predicting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sample questionnaire filling:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722500/extras/6232f6fb53db54d1ece34b15f6d5c053.poster.avif?t=1750296368\" width=800 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722500/extras/6232f6fb53db54d1ece34b15f6d5c053.webm?t=1750296368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722500/extras/6232f6fb53db54d1ece34b15f6d5c053.mp4?t=1750296368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Predicted death countdown and switching display mode: year-month-day-hour-minute-second, remaining days, remaining seconds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722500/extras/d3ef08e4275e26e1fe1b69f4f0831e07.poster.avif?t=1750296368\" width=800 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722500/extras/d3ef08e4275e26e1fe1b69f4f0831e07.webm?t=1750296368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722500/extras/d3ef08e4275e26e1fe1b69f4f0831e07.mp4?t=1750296368